WEBVTT

00:04.422 --> 00:06.663
Welcome to Mare Tranquilitatis.

00:08.964 --> 00:13.706
The Sea of Tranquility. A lunar basin spanning

00:13.806 --> 00:18.569
over 800 kilometers across the surface. Here,

00:19.749 --> 00:23.191
there is no atmosphere. There is no weather.

00:25.212 --> 00:30.178
There is no wind to disturb the dust. It is a place

00:30.218 --> 00:35.106
of absolute, unbroken silence. A permanent

00:35.186 --> 00:40.054
monument to the freezing scale of the vacuum.

01:10.115 --> 01:13.196
I cross the border to the sea of tranquility

01:16.317 --> 01:20.359
No wind, no waves, just an endless facility

01:23.900 --> 01:28.042
The dust is untouched by a single human hand A

01:30.383 --> 01:37.455
billion years of silence in the silver sand I

01:37.495 --> 01:41.718
look for a horizon, but the line is completely

01:41.818 --> 01:48.424
gone Just an infinite black, where the sun

01:48.504 --> 01:55.149
hasn't shone The communications array is

01:55.249 --> 02:02.434
completely dark Not a single transmission, not

02:02.474 --> 02:04.156
a single spar

02:06.562 --> 02:12.265
I am floating at the bottom of the deepest sea

02:12.505 --> 02:16.467
Welcome to the silent ocean Drifting here

02:16.527 --> 02:21.089
without any motion A million stars, but not a

02:21.190 --> 02:28.333
single sound No up, no down, no solid ground It's

02:28.393 --> 02:33.016
beautiful and it's freezing cold A story of the

02:33.096 --> 02:35.557
void that was never told

02:38.220 --> 02:40.061
The silent ocean

02:43.024 --> 02:46.907
I can see the galaxy spiraling out of reach Like

02:46.967 --> 02:50.890
tiny glowing shells on an empty beach The sheer

02:50.910 --> 02:55.053
scale of it is crushing my chest A terrifying

02:55.233 --> 02:58.656
piece of permanent rest There is no friction

02:58.836 --> 03:05.884
here, there is no air Just the overwhelming

03:05.984 --> 03:08.386
weight of the empty stair

03:10.928 --> 03:15.352
The communications array is completely dark

03:17.393 --> 03:22.998
Not a single transmission Not a single spar

03:25.380 --> 03:29.343
I am floating at the bottom of the deepest sea

03:31.262 --> 03:35.304
Welcome to the silent ocean Drifting here

03:35.364 --> 03:39.866
without any motion A million stars, but not a

03:39.966 --> 03:47.109
single sound No up, no down, no solid ground It's

03:47.169 --> 03:51.791
beautiful, and it's freezing cold A story of the

03:51.871 --> 03:54.372
void that was never told

03:56.994 --> 03:58.634
The silent ocean

04:16.900 --> 04:24.682
Absolute zero. The freezing of time. A perfect

04:24.802 --> 04:32.944
vacuum. A mountain I can't climb. Welcome to the

04:33.044 --> 04:37.226
silent ocean. Drifting here without any

04:37.306 --> 04:42.107
motion. A million stars, but not a single sound.

04:42.247 --> 04:49.041
No up, no down, no solid ground. It's beautiful,

04:49.441 --> 04:53.403
and it's freezing cold. A story of the void that

04:53.443 --> 04:55.885
was never told.

04:57.886 --> 05:04.630
The silent ocean.

05:04.650 --> 05:05.870
Very tranquil it does.

05:12.474 --> 05:13.715
Not a single sound.

05:31.432 --> 05:31.732
you.

